  "answer": "This request has been made several times before. Past tickets (#40247, #42192, #18962, #25565) were closed as duplicates of the main tracking issues (#8756, and earlier #828 and #3583), so you can add your support and details there. The key answer came in #45987: PowerToys cannot customize the Windows taskbar directly because the APIs are private, so a taskbar-embedded indicator is not feasible from PowerToys. The maintainers suggested filing it in the Windows Feedback Hub (WinKey+F) instead. As an in-PowerToys alternative, they pointed to the concepts in #45201, which are not on the taskbar. Since you already know about the Command Palette Dock monitor, that is the closest option available today."
